  "title": "Awesome Red Wine Pot Roast",
  "description": "This awesome red wine pot roast recipe slow cooks beef chuck roast in the oven with red wine, basil, marjoram, thyme, potatoes, carrots, and onions.",
  "authors": [
    "KarenCooks"
  ],
